        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"background:#05060f;min-height:88vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:2vw;box-sizing:border-box;\"><div style=\"font-size:4.5vw;font-weight:bold;color:#7fe9ff;letter-spacing:0.3vw;margin:1.2vw 0;\">FIVE STATIONS. ONE CREW.</div><div style=\"font-size:2.6vw;color:#39ff88;line-height:1.5;margin:0.9vw 0;\">Before entering each station, you must scan your crew chip to register your arrival.</div><div style=\"font-size:2.6vw;color:#39ff88;line-height:1.5;margin:0.9vw 0;\">Complete the challenge together.</div><div style=\"font-size:2.6vw;color:#39ff88;line-height:1.5;margin:0.9vw 0;\">When the task is finished, you must submit your feedback before moving on.</div><div style=\"font-size:2.6vw;color:#39ff88;line-height:1.5;margin:0.9vw 0;\">Then scan in at the next station.</div><div style=\"font-size:2.8vw;font-weight:bold;color:#ffd23f;letter-spacing:0.3vw;margin:1.2vw 0;\">Five stations. Five challenges. One final assessment.</div></div>",
